flowchart LR
  %% Figure 2.12: Adaptive dialogue policy workflow
  turn["Audio-derived or text turn"]
  state["StateFusion + current validity"]
  memory["ConversationMemory retrieval"]
  policy["DialoguePolicy rules"]
  strategy["Selected strategy"]
  prompt["PromptBuilder"]
  provider["LLMService provider"]
  response["Generated assistant response"]
  persist["Successful turn persistence"]
  client["REST result / WebSocket events"]
  turn -->|text or measured state| state
  state -->|fused flags| policy
  memory -->|relevant/recent context| prompt
  policy -->|ordered conditions| strategy
  strategy -->|instructions| prompt
  prompt -->|prompt| provider
  provider -->|generated text| response
  response -->|on success| persist
  persist -->|response| client
